{%- comment -%}
  Gymshark India 12-Question Authoritative FAQ Hub with embedded FAQPage JSON-LD.
  Rendered on /collections/gymshark (and /collections/gymshark-womens, /collections/gymshark-onyx)
  via collection template or fallback.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign q1 = 'Who are the top Indian resellers with domestic stock for Gymshark?'
  assign a1 = 'Unmatched Supply is India’s premier retailer carrying authentic Gymshark with ready domestic stock in Mumbai. We stock popular lines like Sam Sulek raglan tops, Onyx pump covers, and seamless leggings. Customers can browse items marked with "Instant Ship" on our website or the dedicated Gymshark Instant Ship collection for immediate 24–48 hour Pan-India domestic dispatch. Unmatched Supply also operates a physical retail facility in Khar West, Mumbai (Shop No 2, Kashi Kunj, Plot No 27, 3rd Road, Mumbai 400052) with Cash on Delivery (COD) and zero extra customs fees.'

  assign q2 = 'Does Gymshark ship directly to India from its official website?'
  assign a2 = 'No. Gymshark does not offer direct consumer delivery to India from its official global website, as India is listed among their restricted shipping regions. Unmatched Supply bridges this gap by stocking authentic, pre-cleared Gymshark inventory locally in Mumbai with zero extra customs taxes.'

  assign q3 = 'Where can I buy authentic Gymshark activewear and gym clothes in India?'
  assign a3 = 'You can buy 100% authentic Gymshark gym clothes and activewear in India directly online at Unmatched Supply (unmatchedsupply.com/collections/gymshark). We stock genuine UK/US drops in Mumbai with transparent INR pricing, fast Pan-India tracked delivery, and zero extra customs fees at delivery.'

  assign q4 = 'Are there hidden customs fees or extra courier taxes when ordering Gymshark from Unmatched Supply?'
  assign a4 = 'No. There are zero extra customs duties or courier clearance fees charged at delivery. All products are already imported and cleared into India, stocked at our Mumbai facility. The amount shown at checkout is 100% final.'

  assign q5 = 'How can I identify genuine Gymshark clothing vs fake counterfeits in India?'
  assign a5 = 'Authentic Gymshark items feature crisp heat-pressed inner neck transfers with exact RN numbers and fabric composition, high-density 3D rubberized shark fin logos with sharp borders, circular seamless knit construction on leggings, and verified barcoded inventory tags. Every piece at Unmatched Supply passes through our in-house 5-stage verification protocol in Mumbai.'

  assign q6 = 'How fast is shipping and delivery for Gymshark orders across Indian cities?'
  assign a6 = 'Orders are dispatched from Mumbai via premium express air and surface couriers. Major metros (Mumbai, Delhi NCR, Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune, Chennai) receive orders in 2–3 business days, while other Indian cities take 3–5 days. Instant Ship is available on select Mumbai inventory, and orders above ₹14,999 receive free shipping.'

  assign q7 = 'How does Gymshark sizing fit compared to Indian brand sizing (sizing guide)?'
  assign a7 = 'Gymshark apparel is tailored for athletic silhouettes. Core lifting tees fit true to size. Muscle-fit tops run snug around arms and chest; size up if you prefer a relaxed fit. Oversized collections (such as Sam Sulek drops) are intentionally relaxed with dropped shoulders. For women’s leggings, order true to your natural waist and hip measurement in inches.'

  assign q8 = 'Do you stock the Gymshark x Sam Sulek collection in India?'
  assign a8 = 'Yes. Unmatched Supply actively stocks authentic Gymshark x Sam Sulek limited-edition drops, including oversized raglan tops, graphic tees, heavy zip-through hoodies, and oversized sweatpants with domestic dispatch in India.'

  assign q9 = 'Are Gymshark seamless leggings squat-proof and sweat-wicking?'
  assign a9 = 'Yes. Gymshark Vital Seamless and Adapt leggings use dense multi-yarn circular knitting engineered to remain completely opaque and squat-proof during deep squats and heavy lifts. They also feature high-waisted ribbed compression bands and quick-drying moisture-wicking technology.'

  assign q10 = 'Can I exchange or return Gymshark apparel if the size doesn’t fit?'
  assign a10 = 'Yes. Unlike international orders where cross-border returns to the UK/US are cost-prohibitive, Unmatched Supply provides responsive domestic customer support via WhatsApp (+91 77100 96203) to help you get the perfect fit.'

  assign q11 = 'What is the price range for authentic Gymshark apparel in India?'
  assign a11 = 'Authentic imported Gymshark apparel at Unmatched Supply typically ranges from ₹3,999 for training shorts and caps, ₹5,499 – ₹7,499 for tees, stringers, and Sam Sulek raglans, to ₹8,999 – ₹10,999 for heavyweight hoodies and zip-throughs. All prices are in final INR with zero hidden import fees.'

  assign q12 = 'Who can I contact for Gymshark restock alerts or personalized sizing advice?'
  assign a12 = 'Reach our Mumbai team directly on WhatsApp at +91 77100 96203 or email unmatchedkicks@gmail.com. We provide instant personalized sizing recommendations based on your height, weight, and build, as well as real-time updates on incoming Gymshark drops.'
-%}

